#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:6
msgid "Visuo-Tactile Sensor"
msgstr "视触觉传感器"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:9
msgid ""
"The visuo-tactile sensor in Isaac Lab provides realistic tactile feedback"
" through integration with TacSL (Tactile Sensor Learning) [Akinola2025]_."
" It is designed to simulate high-fidelity tactile interactions, "
"generating both visual and force-based data that mirror real-world "
"tactile sensors like GelSight devices. The sensor can provide tactile RGB"
" images, force field distributions, and other intermediate tactile "
"measurements essential for robotic manipulation tasks requiring fine "
"tactile feedback."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 中的视触觉传感器通过与 TacSL（触觉传感器学习）[Akinola2025]_ 集成，提供逼真的触觉反馈。"
"它旨在模拟高保真触觉交互，生成视觉和力反馈数据，模拟真实世界的触觉传感器（如 GelSight 设备）。"
"该传感器可以提供触觉 RGB 图像、力场分布以及其他中间触觉测量数据，这些对于需要精细触觉反馈的机器人操作任务至关重要。"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:-1
msgid "Tactile sensor with RGB visualization and force fields"
msgstr "带有 RGB 可视化和力场的触觉传感器"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:19
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:21
msgid ""
"Tactile sensors require specific configuration parameters to define their"
" behavior and data collection properties. The sensor can be configured "
"with various parameters including sensor resolution, force sensitivity, "
"and output data types."
msgstr ""
"触觉传感器需要特定的配置参数来定义其行为和数据采集属性。传感器可以配置各种参数，包括传感器分辨率、力敏感度和输出数据类型。"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:57
msgid "The configuration supports customization of:"
msgstr "配置支持自定义以下内容: "

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:59
msgid ""
"**Render Configuration**: Specify the GelSight sensor rendering "
"parameters using predefined configs (e.g., ``GELSIGHT_R15_CFG``, "
"``GELSIGHT_MINI_CFG`` from ``isaaclab_assets.sensors``)"
msgstr ""
"**渲染配置**: 使用预定义配置（例如来自 ``isaaclab_assets.sensors`` 的 ``GELSIGHT_R15_CFG`` 、 "
"``GELSIGHT_MINI_CFG`` ）指定 GelSight 传感器渲染参数"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:62
msgid "**Tactile Modalities**:"
msgstr "**触觉模态**:"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:62
msgid ""
"``enable_camera_tactile`` - Enable tactile RGB imaging through camera "
"sensors"
msgstr "``enable_camera_tactile`` - 通过相机传感器启用触觉 RGB 成像"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:63
msgid "``enable_force_field`` - Enable force field computation and visualization"
msgstr "``enable_force_field`` - 启用力场计算和可视化"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:64
msgid ""
"**Force Field Grid**: Set tactile grid dimensions "
"(``tactile_array_size``) and margins, which directly affects the spatial "
"resolution of the computed force field"
msgstr ""
"**力场网格**: 设置触觉网格尺寸（ ``tactile_array_size`` ）和边距，这直接影响计算力场的空间分辨率"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:65
msgid ""
"**Contact Object Configuration**: Define properties of interacting "
"objects using prim path expressions to locate objects with SDF collision "
"meshes"
msgstr ""
"**接触对象配置**: 使用 prim 路径表达式定义交互对象的属性，以定位具有 SDF 碰撞网格的对象"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:66
msgid "**Physics Parameters**: Control the sensor's force field computation:"
msgstr "**物理参数**: 控制传感器的力场计算:"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:67
msgid ""
"``normal_contact_stiffness``, ``friction_coefficient``, "
"``tangential_stiffness`` - Normal stiffness, friction coefficient, and "
"tangential stiffness"
msgstr ""
"``normal_contact_stiffness``, ``friction_coefficient``, ``tangential_stiffness`` - 法向刚度、摩擦系数和切向刚度"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:70
msgid ""
"**Camera Settings**: Configure resolution, update rates, and data types, "
"currently only ``distance_to_image_plane`` (alias for ``depth``) is "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"**相机设置**: 配置分辨率、更新速率和数据类型，目前仅支持 ``distance_to_image_plane`` （ ``depth`` 的别名）。"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:69
msgid ""
"``spawn`` is set to ``None`` by default, which means that the camera is "
"already spawned in the USD file. If you want to spawn the camera yourself"
" and set focal length, etc., you can set the spawn configuration to a "
"valid spawn configuration."
msgstr ""
"``spawn`` 默认设置为 ``None`` ，这意味着相机已在 USD 文件中生成。如果您想自己生成相机并设置焦距等，"
"可以将 spawn 配置设置为有效的生成配置。"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:73
msgid "Configuration Requirements"
msgstr "配置要求"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:76
msgid "The following requirements must be satisfied for proper sensor operation:"
msgstr "传感器正常运行必须满足以下要求:"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:79
msgid "**Camera Tactile Imaging**"
msgstr "**相机触觉成像**"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:79
msgid ""
"If ``enable_camera_tactile=True``, a valid ``camera_cfg`` "
"(TiledCameraCfg) must be provided with appropriate camera parameters."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``enable_camera_tactile=True`` ，必须提供有效的 ``camera_cfg`` （TiledCameraCfg）及适当的相机参数。"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:84
msgid "**Force Field Computation**"
msgstr "**力场计算**"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:82
msgid "If ``enable_force_field=True``, the following parameters are required:"
msgstr "如果 ``enable_force_field=True`` ，需要以下参数: "

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:84
msgid ""
"``contact_object_prim_path_expr`` - Prim path expression to locate "
"contact objects with SDF collision meshes"
msgstr ""
"``contact_object_prim_path_expr`` - 用于定位具有 SDF 碰撞网格的接触对象的 Prim 路径表达式"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:90
msgid "**SDF Computation**"
msgstr "**SDF 计算**"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:87
msgid ""
"When force field computation is enabled, penalty-based normal and shear "
"forces are computed using Signed Distance Field (SDF) queries. To achieve"
" GPU acceleration:"
msgstr ""
"当启用力场计算时，使用符号距离场（SDF）查询计算基于惩罚的法向力和剪切力。要实现 GPU 加速: "

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:89
msgid "Interacting objects should have SDF collision meshes"
msgstr "交互对象应具有 SDF 碰撞网格"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:90
msgid ""
"An SDFView must be defined during initialization, therefore interacting "
"objects should be specified before simulation."
msgstr ""
"必须在初始化期间定义 SDFView，因此应在仿真之前指定交互对象。"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:94
msgid "**Elastomer Configuration**"
msgstr "**弹性体配置**"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:93
msgid ""
"The sensor's ``prim_path`` must be configured as a child of the elastomer"
" prim in the USD hierarchy. The query points for the force field "
"computation is computed from the surface of the elastomer mesh, which is "
"searched for under the prim path of the elastomer."
msgstr ""
"传感器的 ``prim_path`` 必须配置为 USD 层次结构中弹性体 prim 的子级。力场计算的查询点是从弹性体网格表面计算的，"
"该网格在弹性体的 prim 路径下搜索。"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:105
msgid "**Physics Materials**"
msgstr "**物理材质**"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:97
msgid ""
"The sensor uses physics materials to configure the compliant contact "
"properties of the elastomer. By default, physics material properties are "
"pre-configured in the USD asset. However, you can override these "
"properties by specifying the following parameters in "
"``UsdFileWithCompliantContactCfg`` when spawning the robot:"
msgstr ""
"传感器使用物理材质来配置弹性体的柔顺接触属性。默认情况下，物理材质属性已在 USD 资产中预配置。"
"但是，您可以在生成机器人时通过在 ``UsdFileWithCompliantContactCfg`` 中指定以下参数来覆盖这些属性: "

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:102
msgid ""
"``compliant_contact_stiffness`` - Contact stiffness for the elastomer "
"surface"
msgstr "``compliant_contact_stiffness`` - 弹性体表面的接触刚度"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:103
msgid "``compliant_contact_damping`` - Contact damping for the elastomer surface"
msgstr "``compliant_contact_damping`` - 弹性体表面的接触阻尼"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:104
msgid ""
"``physics_material_prim_path`` - Prim path where physics material is "
"applied (typically ``\"elastomer\"``)"
msgstr "``physics_material_prim_path`` - 应用物理材质的 Prim 路径（通常为 ``\"elastomer\"`` ）"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:106
msgid ""
"If any parameter is set to ``None``, the corresponding property from the "
"USD asset will be retained."
msgstr "如果任何参数设置为 ``None`` ，将保留 USD 资产中的相应属性。"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:110
msgid "Usage Example"
msgstr "使用示例"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:112
msgid "To use the tactile sensor in a simulation environment, run the demo:"
msgstr "要在仿真环境中使用触觉传感器，请运行演示: "

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:119
msgid "Available command-line options include:"
msgstr "可用的命令行选项包括: "

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:121
msgid "``--use_tactile_rgb``: Enable camera-based tactile sensing"
msgstr "``--use_tactile_rgb``: 启用基于相机的触觉感知"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:122
msgid "``--use_tactile_ff``: Enable force field tactile sensing"
msgstr "``--use_tactile_ff``: 启用力场触觉感知"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:123
msgid ""
"``--contact_object_type``: Specify the type of contact object (nut, cube,"
" etc.)"
msgstr "``--contact_object_type``: 指定接触对象的类型（螺母、立方体等）"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:124
msgid "``--num_envs``: Number of parallel environments"
msgstr "``--num_envs``: 并行环境数量"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:125
msgid "``--save_viz``: Save visualization outputs for analysis"
msgstr "``--save_viz``: 保存可视化输出以供分析"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:126
msgid ""
"``--tactile_compliance_stiffness``: Override compliant contact stiffness "
"(default: use USD asset values)"
msgstr "``--tactile_compliance_stiffness``: 覆盖柔顺接触刚度（默认: 使用 USD 资产值）"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:127
msgid ""
"``--tactile_compliant_damping``: Override compliant contact damping "
"(default: use USD asset values)"
msgstr "``--tactile_compliant_damping``: 覆盖柔顺接触阻尼（默认: 使用 USD 资产值）"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:128
msgid ""
"``--normal_contact_stiffness``: Normal contact stiffness for force field "
"computation"
msgstr "``--normal_contact_stiffness``: 力场计算的法向接触刚度"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:129
msgid "``--tangential_stiffness``: Tangential stiffness for shear forces"
msgstr "``--tangential_stiffness``: 剪切力的切向刚度"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:130
msgid "``--friction_coefficient``: Friction coefficient for shear forces"
msgstr "``--friction_coefficient``: 剪切力的摩擦系数"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:131
msgid "``--debug_sdf_closest_pts``: Visualize closest SDF points for debugging"
msgstr "``--debug_sdf_closest_pts``: 可视化最近的 SDF 点以进行调试"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:132
msgid ""
"``--debug_tactile_sensor_pts``: Visualize tactile sensor points for "
"debugging"
msgstr "``--debug_tactile_sensor_pts``: 可视化触觉传感器点以进行调试"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:133
msgid ""
"``--trimesh_vis_tactile_points``: Enable trimesh-based visualization of "
"tactile points"
msgstr "``--trimesh_vis_tactile_points``: 启用基于 trimesh 的触觉点可视化"

#: ../../source/overview/core-concepts/sensors/visuo_tactile_sensor.rst:135
msgid "For a complete list of available options:"
msgstr "要获取完整的可用选项列表: "

